# Use the deployed HTTPS URL and an organization-scoped delegated API token.
@baseUrl = https://license.example.invalid
@organizationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@campaignId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@itemId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@token = replace-with-delegated-api-token

### Organization-wide completion, overdue work, current exception aging and audit history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/governance/report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eligible active owners and reviewers (creator is still excluded by assignment validation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/governance/assignees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audited reassignment; use the item's current assignmentVersion and a future UTC date
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/access-reviews/{{campaignId}}/items/{{itemId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

{
  "expectedAssignmentVersion": 0,
  "owner": "owner@example.invalid",
  "reviewer": "reviewer@example.invalid",
  "team": "Platform",
  "externalAccountId": "123456789012",
  "dueAtUtc": "2030-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Ownership transferred to the platform team"
}

### Unknown campaign/item (404); stale version on a real item returns 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/access-reviews/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/{{itemId}}/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedAssignmentVersion": 0,
  "owner": null,
  "reviewer": "reviewer@example.invalid",
  "team": null,
  "externalAccountId": null,
  "dueAtUtc": "2030-12-01T00:00:00Z",
  "reason": "Unknown campaign example"
}
